specs/hal-engine-subprotocol-marker/spec.md:13:- The server answers `hal.v1` whenever it is offered, whether before the token or after it ([validated by: answers the marker when it is offered first, never the token beside it](../../src/transport/ws/subprotocol.test.ts#L23), [validated by: answers the marker when it is offered after the token](../../src/transport/ws/subprotocol.test.ts#L27)).
